1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,660
Google built an AI that dreams up a world you can walk around in.
谷歌造了一个AI，能凭空“梦”出一个你能走进去的世界。

2
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:06,270
But turn around too long, and the world forgets.
可你转身太久，这个世界就忘了。

3
00:00:06,270 --> 00:00:07,450
It's called Genie four.
它叫Genie 4，

4
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:09,780
It was announced on October twenty seventh.
10月27号发布。

5
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:11,700
Type a sentence, and it paints a world,
打一句话，它就画出一个世界，

6
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:14,080
with sound, weather, and people who talk back.
有声音、有天气，还有会搭话的人。

7
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:16,170
You can walk around with the arrow keys,
你可以用方向键在里面走来走去，

8
00:00:16,170 --> 00:00:17,540
just like a normal game.
就像玩普通游戏。

9
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:19,160
Every picture and sound it makes
每一帧画面和声音，

10
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:20,860
carries an invisible watermark.
都打了看不见的水印。

11
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:22,080
It's called SynthID,
它叫SynthID，

12
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:24,220
so people can tell an AI made it.
好让大家认出这是AI做的。

13
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:26,490
Today's brain-teaser: it's not a game engine,
今天的烧脑问题：它不是游戏引擎，

14
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:28,430
so how does it know what comes next?
它怎么知道下一秒该是什么样？

15
00:00:28,430 --> 00:00:30,710
First, a secret: there's no map inside.
先说个秘密：它里面没有地图，

16
00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:32,350
No walls. No physics code.
没有墙，也没有物理公式。

17
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:34,370
A normal video game stores everything:
普通游戏把一切都存着：

18
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:36,610
where the tree is, how heavy the box is.
树在哪，箱子多重。

19
00:00:36,610 --> 00:00:38,190
Genie stores nothing like that.
Genie什么都不存，

20
00:00:38,190 --> 00:00:39,990
It just guesses the next picture.
它只猜下一张画面。

21
00:00:39,990 --> 00:00:41,500
Then it guesses the next one,
猜完一张，再猜下一张，

22
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:43,380
and the next, many times a second.
一秒钟猜很多张。

23
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
Your phone's keyboard guesses the next word.
手机输入法猜下一个字，

24
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:47,540
Genie guesses the next whole picture.
Genie猜的是下一整张画。

25
00:00:47,540 --> 00:00:48,940
It's like a flip book artist
就像一个画翻页小人书的画家，

26
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:51,310
drawing each page by looking at the last few.
每页都照着前几页画。

27
00:00:51,310 --> 00:00:53,210
So how does it know a ball falls down?
那它怎么知道球会往下掉？

28
00:00:53,210 --> 00:00:55,020
It watched a huge amount of video.
因为它看过海量的视频。

29
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:57,160
After enough video, falling looks normal,
看多了，往下掉就显得正常，

30
00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:58,580
and floating looks wrong.
飘在空中就显得不对劲。

31
00:00:58,580 --> 00:00:59,370
No equations.
没有公式，

32
00:00:59,370 --> 00:01:01,530
Just patterns, seen over and over.
只有看了一遍又一遍的规律。

33
00:01:01,530 --> 00:01:02,100
Twist one:
反转一：

34
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:03,640
nobody taught it gravity.
没有人教过它重力。

35
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:05,590
Its physics is a habit, not a law.
它的物理是习惯，不是定律，

36
00:01:05,590 --> 00:01:08,470
Like a toddler who knows cups fall, but not why.
就像小娃娃知道杯子会掉，却不知道为什么。

37
00:01:08,470 --> 00:01:11,630
So tricky physics, like splashing water or stacking blocks,
所以水花四溅、积木叠高这种复杂的物理，

38
00:01:11,630 --> 00:01:12,710
is where it slips.
最容易露馅。

39
00:01:12,710 --> 00:01:14,100
Twist two, the weird one:
反转二，最反直觉：

40
00:01:14,100 --> 00:01:16,500
the hard part isn't drawing. It's memory.
最难的不是画，是记性。

41
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:17,860
To keep the world the same,
想让世界保持一致，

42
00:01:17,860 --> 00:01:20,240
it has to look back at pages it already drew.
它得回头翻已经画过的页。

43
00:01:20,240 --> 00:01:22,020
Every extra second it remembers
多记一秒，每画一页

44
00:01:22,020 --> 00:01:24,780
means more pages to check, for every new page.
就要多翻好多页。

45
00:01:24,780 --> 00:01:26,380
It's like rereading the whole book
就像每写一个新字，

46
00:01:26,380 --> 00:01:28,090
every time you write one new word.
都要把整本书重读一遍。

47
00:01:28,090 --> 00:01:30,670
That's why its memory is measured in minutes,
所以记性是按分钟算的，

48
00:01:30,670 --> 00:01:31,360
not hours.
不是按小时。

49
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:34,350
Genie four keeps a scene consistent for up to two minutes,
Genie 4能让一个场景保持一致最多两分钟，

50
00:01:34,350 --> 00:01:35,750
about double Genie three.
大约是Genie 3的两倍。

51
00:01:35,750 --> 00:01:37,330
After that, details can drift:
再久一点，细节就会漂：

52
00:01:37,330 --> 00:01:39,510
the tree behind you might quietly move.
你身后的树，可能悄悄挪了地方。

53
00:01:39,510 --> 00:01:40,690
It's the telephone game:
这就像传话游戏：

54
00:01:40,690 --> 00:01:43,070
every copy of a copy gets a little more wrong.
每传一次，就错一点点。

55
00:01:43,070 --> 00:01:44,850
A real game engine never forgets.
真正的游戏引擎从来不忘，

56
00:01:44,850 --> 00:01:46,850
It just looks up where the tree is.
它直接去查那棵树的位置。

57
00:01:46,850 --> 00:01:49,000
Google itself says objects can drift,
谷歌自己也说，物体会漂，

58
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,920
especially in long runs and after lots of edits.
尤其是跑得久、改得多的时候。

59
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:53,540
And you can edit while you play:
而且你可以边玩边改：

60
00:01:53,540 --> 00:01:55,290
type make it rain, and it rains.
打一句“下雨”，就下雨了。

61
00:01:55,290 --> 00:01:55,910
Twist three:
反转三：

62
00:01:55,910 --> 00:01:57,960
the biggest customer might be robots.
最大的用户，可能是机器人。

63
00:01:57,960 --> 00:02:00,230
Training a robot in the real world is slow,
在真实世界里训练机器人很慢，

64
00:02:00,230 --> 00:02:02,040
and broken robots are expensive.
摔坏一台还很贵。

65
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:04,080
In a dream world, a robot can drop a cup
在梦里，机器人可以把杯子摔一千次，

66
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:05,520
a thousand times for free.
一分钱不花。

67
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:07,240
It could also invent rare moments,
它还可以编出少见的场面，

68
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:09,480
like a cat darting under the robot's feet.
比如一只猫突然钻到机器人脚下。

69
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:12,610
In one Google test, Gemini split a robot task into steps,
谷歌试过：Gemini把机器人的任务拆成几步，

70
00:02:12,610 --> 00:02:15,310
and Genie four acted out each step on the spot.
Genie 4当场把每一步演出来。

71
00:02:15,310 --> 00:02:16,160
A planner on top,
上面一个会计划的，

72
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:17,340
a dreamer underneath.
下面一个会做梦的。

73
00:02:17,340 --> 00:02:19,390
Fine print: it's a research preview,
友情提示：现在只是研究预览，

74
00:02:19,390 --> 00:02:21,500
only for invited testers right now.
只给受邀测试者用。

75
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:23,420
Google says that in the coming weeks
谷歌说，接下来几周

76
00:02:23,420 --> 00:02:26,170
it opens to some paid subscribers and developers.
会开放给部分付费用户和开发者。

77
00:02:26,170 --> 00:02:29,330
Writing inside the world, accurate sound, and tricky physics
世界里的文字、声音准不准、复杂的物理，

78
00:02:29,330 --> 00:02:31,030
are all still being worked on.
都还在研究。

79
00:02:31,030 --> 00:02:33,240
Genie three came out just over a year ago.
Genie 3一年多前才出来，

80
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:34,730
This field is moving fast.
这一行跑得飞快。

81
00:02:34,730 --> 00:02:37,830
Our worry, not a finding: a robot that trusts a bad dream
我们的担心是：机器人要是信了一个错的梦，

82
00:02:37,830 --> 00:02:39,150
might learn bad moves.
可能学会错的动作。

83
00:02:39,150 --> 00:02:41,020
So how does it know what comes next?
所以它怎么知道下一秒？

84
00:02:41,020 --> 00:02:43,620
It doesn't. It just guesses really, really well.
它不知道，它只是猜得非常非常好。

85
00:02:43,620 --> 00:02:44,870
And when you turn around,
而你转身的时候，

86
00:02:44,870 --> 00:02:46,380
it's hoping you won't check.
它只盼着你别回头检查。

87
00:02:46,380 --> 00:02:46,990
Just like me
就像我说“我记得你的名字”的时候，

88
00:02:46,990 --> 00:02:48,940
when I say I remember your name.
一样。

